OL,3,GNEWSARave in Little Snoring shut down
OL,4,Aand five arrested
OL,5,
OL,6,FFive people were arrested in the
OL,7,Fvillage of Little Snoring after police
OL,8,Fshut down an unlicensed music event.
OL,10,FNorfolk Police was called just after
OL,11,F01:00 BST on Sunday to the event near
OL,12,FThursford Road in the village.
OL,14,FGenerators, vehicles and sound
OL,15,Fequipment were seized, the force added.
OL,17,FThe five people were arrested in
OL,18,Fconnection with the event for offences
OL,19,Fincluding drug driving, drink driving,
OL,20,Fpossession of a class A drug with
OL,21,Fintent to supply and carrying on a
OL,22,Flicensable activity without a licence.
OL,23,APub: 24-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
